'''One-off''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete wave 11 of the [[Fortis Colosseum]] with either the 'Red Flag', 'Dynamic Duo', or 'Doom II' [[Fortis Colosseum#Handicaps|handicaps]] active.

==Strategy==
Of the three, Dynamic Duo is the least dangerous option, since mages are the easiest mobs to deal with overall. Red Flag will result in the [[Minotaur (Fortis Colosseum)|minotaur]] being able to path around pillars and prevent it from being safespotted, while Doom II removes the ability to recover from mistakes with brews.

Wave 11 consists of a Fremennik warband, one [[Javelin Colossus]], one [[Shockwave Colossus]] (two if Dynamic Duo), two [[manticore]]s along with a minotaur and [[serpent shaman]] as reinforcements.

